implementationPlan.description:
Create a `writeJSON` helper function in a new file `core/controlplane/gateway/json_helpers.go`:
```go
func writeJSON(w http.ResponseWriter, v any) {
    w.Header().Set("Content-Type", "application/json")
    if err := json.NewEncoder(w).Encode(v); err != nil {
        slog.Warn("json encode failed", "error", err)
    }
}
```
Keep it simple — the `Content-Type` header is likely already set in most handlers, so only set it if not already present, or just always set it (idempotent).
